----Commands----
`/tame` is an alias for `/tames`.

/tames
Lists all your registered tames.

/tames strongest
Shows short stats for your strongest tame.

/tames stat <name>
Shows full/long stats for that tame.

/tames <name> long
Also shows long stats (legacy style).

/tames info
Shows command overview.

/tames info <command>
Shows details for one command topic.

/tames info ability <abilityId>
Shows the exact ability section from `AbilitiesDocu.md`.

/tames info attribute <attributeId>
Shows the exact attribute section from `AttributesDocu.md`.

/tame info
Same as `/tames info`.

