----Targets----
/tames removeTarget
Removes target from all loaded tames you own.

/tames removeTarget <name>
Removes target from one loaded tame.

/tames removeTarget group <groupName>
Removes targets from loaded tames in that group.

/tames removeTarget type <typeName>
/tames removeTarget state <follow|wander|sit>

----Respawn----
/tames respawn <name> [toMe]
/tames respawn group <groupName> [toMe]
/tames respawn type <typeName> [toMe]
/tames respawn all [toMe]

----Emergency----
/tames berserk
Sets nearby owned tames to `monster_hunter`.

/tames passive
Sets nearby owned tames to passive and clears their targets.

----XP / Abilities / Attributes----
/tames xp add <pet> <amount>
/tames xp remove <pet> <amount>

/tames ability add <id> <pet> [levels]
/tames ability remove <id> <pet> [levels]
/tames ability clear <pet>
/tames ability list <pet>

/tames attribute add <id> <pet> [levels]
/tames attribute remove <id> <pet> [levels]
/tames attribute clear <pet>
/tames attribute list <pet>

----Auto Follow----
When an owner changes dimension, loaded owned tames that are following (not sitting)
are teleported to the owner after ~1 second automatically.

----Debug----
/tames debug enemyKilled <true|false>
Shows kill debug:
enemyKilled true/false: Killed: MobType[xp give]: K: Killer Name, A: Assister Name...

/tames debug abilityUsed <true|false>
Enables/disables ability usage chat messages.

/tames debug attributeUsed <true|false>
Enables/disables attribute usage chat messages.

----Admin----
/tames admin normalizeBonuses all
Rebuilds loaded tame combat stats as: base stats of tame type + stored bonuses.

/tames admin normalizeBonuses <pet>
Same normalization for one loaded tame.

/tames admin xp add|remove <pet> <amount>
/tames admin ability add|remove|clear|list ...
/tames admin attribute add|remove|clear|list ...
/tames admin removeTarget [<name>|group <name>|type <name>|state <follow|wander|sit>]
